{"pageid": 341, "title": "Enter the House of Slaughter", "revid": 1854, "categories": ["Comics", "Spinoffs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\"><i>Enter the House of Slaughter</i></h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b4/Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241027083727\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Enter the House of Slaughter Cover\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b4/Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241027083727\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b4/Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241027083727 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b4/Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241027083727 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Enter the House of Slaughter Cover\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Enter the House of Slaughter Cover.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"writer\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colors by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miquel_Muerto\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">Miquel Muerto</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"letters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lettered by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/AndWorld_Design\" title=\"AndWorld Design\">AndWorld Design</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 14, 2021</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Enter the House of Slaughter 2021 FCBD SPECIAL</b></i> is a one-shot horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on August 14, 2021, by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p>ARE YOU READY TO ENTER THE HOUSE OF SLAUGHTER?\n</p><p>In 2019, <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> (<i>Batman</i>) and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> (<i>Briggs Land</i>) introduced the world to <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>, the iconic monster hunter who came to Archer's Peak, Wisconsin to save the town's children from the monsters only she can see.\nBut Erica is not the only member of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>...\n</p><p>\nWith nearly half a million copies sold <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a></i> has become a true comic phenomenon and this Free Comic Book Day you are invited to enter the House of Slaughter... if you dare.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover.jpg\" title=\"Enter the House of Slaughter Cover.jpg (254 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:120px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b4/Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20241027083727\" title=\"Enter the House of Slaughter Cover.jpg (254 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Enter the House of Slaughter Cover.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Enter the House of Slaughter Cover.jpg (254 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Enter the House of Slaughter Cover.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b4/Enter_the_House_of_Slaughter_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20241027083727\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.boom-studios.com/archives/brand-new-werther-delledera-cover-for-enter-the-house-of-slaughter-2021-fcbd-special/\">BRAND NEW WERTHER DELL’EDERA COVER FOR ENTER THE HOUSE OF SLAUGHTER 2021 FCBD SPECIAL - Boom! Studios</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://freecomicbookday.com/Catalog/APR210003\">FCBD 2021 ENTER THE SLAUGHTER - Free Comic Book Day</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:42:49+00:00"}